    {
      "source": "Removes a document.",
      "translation": "删除文档。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Save the entity to couchbase.<br/>\nIf there is no version property on the entity class, and this is in a transaction, use insert. <br/>\nIf there is no version property on the entity class, and this is not in a transaction, use upsert. <br/>\nIf there is a version property on the entity class, and it is non-zero, then this is an existing document, use\nreplace.<br/>\nOtherwise, there is a version property for the entity, but it is zero or null, use insert. <br/>",
      "translation": "将实体保存到 Couchbase。<br/>\n如果实体类上没有版本属性，且处于事务中，则使用 insert。<br/>\n如果实体类上没有版本属性，且不在事务中，则使用 upsert。<br/>\n如果实体类上有版本属性且其值非零，则表示这是一个现有文档，请使用 replace。<br/>\n否则，实体具有版本属性但其值为零或 null，请使用 insert。<br/>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Provides access to a <code>Collection</code> on the configured <a href=\"../CouchbaseClientFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.couchbase\"><code>CouchbaseClientFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "提供对配置的<a href=\"../CouchbaseClientFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.couchbase\"><code>CouchbaseClientFactory</code></a>上的<code>Collection</code>的访问。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Save the entity to couchbase.<br/>\nIf there is no version property on the entity class, and this is in a transaction, use insert.",
